    "description": "Trackify goes beyond Spotify Wrapped, letting your view your exact listening time, stream count, and much more for any time range. With over 200k users across all platforms, we've tracked over 750 million listens.\r\n\r\nAfter importing your Spotify account history, we offer:\r\n\r\n\u23f0 Exact listening counts on your full account history\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 Top Artists, Songs, and Albums for any time range\r\n\ud83e\udd3c Compare your listens with friends & our other users\r\n\ud83e\udd59 Spotify Wrapped all year round\r\n\ud83e\udd47 First listened-to dates for all your favourite songs & artists\r\n\u2795 many more features that we can't fit here!\r\n\r\nBegin your stat-obsessed journey with Trackify, no ads, just stats.",
